{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124190","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012419001:1":{"text":"안되겠어... 제단에 접근할 방법이 없어. 이곳 사람들은 모두 친절해서 거칠게 굴고 싶지도 않고.","source_cn":"不行啊……根本没法接近祭坛。总不能来硬的，这里的人都挺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64CC562548E7168B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012419002:1":{"text":"기도의 날이 다가오면 사람들과 함께 영혼의 언덕으로 들어갈 수 있으니 다행이지만, 당분간은 기다릴 수밖에 없겠어.","source_cn":"好在祈福日临近，那时，我们也能和大家一起进入圣丘。不过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9FB4A546B3F46F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012419003:2":{"text":"이곳 사람들은 친절하지만 전혀 서두르지 않는 것 같아서 왠지 불안하네요...!","source_cn":"虽然这里的人很友好，可他们一点也不着急的样子让我很着急……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22A4977F4B7F218C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012419004:1":{"text":"이미 부패가 심각한 상황인데... 오히려 여유롭다구욧!","source_cn":"明明外面的腐化已经很严重了……这里的人却很悠哉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x615E4BC856494AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012419005:1":{"text":"해미... 좀 참아. 달빛 그림자는 영향을 받지 않았으니 긴장할 것도 없겠지.","source_cn":"漫漫……收收你的急性子。月影乡没受到影响，他们也没什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C36C8835A8951D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_i